## Dependency management with `uv`

- Use `uv` exclusively (no pip/poetry).
- Commands: `uv add <pkg>`, `uv remove <pkg>`, `uv sync`, `uv run <cmd>`, `uv add <pkg> --script script.py`, `uv sync --script script.py`.

```python
# /// script
# requires-python = ">=3.12"
# dependencies = ["package"]
# ///
```
